WEBVTT
Kind: captions
Language: en-IN

00:00:00.917 --> 00:00:03.670
I see the path to victory so certain,

00:00:06.131 --> 00:00:08.174
I will take my place as a conqueror.

00:00:09.342 --> 00:00:10.343
A sorcerer.

00:00:12.554 --> 00:00:13.555
A king.

00:00:16.891 --> 00:00:18.143
We have work to do.

00:00:20.520 --> 00:00:22.063
Sauron's victory's at hand.

00:00:24.733 --> 00:00:28.445
One Ring to rule them all.

00:00:32.741 --> 00:00:35.160
The Enemy has twice our number.

00:00:38.246 --> 00:00:40.874
Together, I know we can turn the tide.

00:00:41.374 --> 00:00:43.335
Kneel to him, Gandalf.

00:00:47.380 --> 00:00:48.715
Let the hunt begin.

00:00:54.971 --> 00:00:57.640
How are we supposed to defeat
The Dark Lord on our own?

00:00:57.724 --> 00:00:58.892
We won't be on our own.

00:01:02.437 --> 00:01:03.813
I came to slay a god.

00:01:05.648 --> 00:01:07.442
There is something you fear to tell me.

00:01:10.862 --> 00:01:12.405
All of it has come to this.

00:01:16.743 --> 00:01:18.244
We have no choice but to act.

00:01:23.041 --> 00:01:24.209
Why are you doing all of this?

00:01:33.677 --> 00:01:35.679
This day, we march together

00:01:39.349 --> 00:01:40.600
to bring order...

00:01:42.018 --> 00:01:43.645
to this broken world.

00:01:47.774 --> 00:01:51.236
We are, all of us,
on the path to ruin now.

